00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:15.180
before I got married.

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:18.126
I just demonstrate what not to do.

00:02:18.126 --> 00:02:19.245
That's a good point.

00:02:19.245 --> 00:02:20.650
Just watch and learn.
And that's a good point.

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:22.780
So just watch and learn.
Watch and unlearn.

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:25.050
I have no clue if there's any lessons

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:26.540
that I should be giving you,

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:28.570
