00:02:28.570 --> 00:02:32.280
that you'll approach it
differently than me, because...

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:38.973
If I can help by being a
bad example, I'll do that.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:41.750
I don't think I did anything wrong.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:44.170
Yeah, I mean, now I'm intrigued.

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:45.520
Now I actually care about this episode.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:48.990
I'm just kidding.

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:50.510
But before we go any further,

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:54.780
as of the release date of this
episode, it's your birthday.

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:57.700
