00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:05.890
Happy 44th birthday, my friend.

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.580
Thank you for that.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:11.490
We were actually talking
with Stevie the other day,

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:13.240
